# Raise graph chat output-token budget (2048 -> 8192, configurable)

Context: Reasoning-capable Claude models (Sonnet/Opus 4.6+, 5.x) spend part of
max_tokens on hidden reasoning. With the hard-coded 2048 budget the chat agent
often received a reasoning-only completion (finish_reason=length, no text) and
the UI showed "I couldn't display that answer". Verified against the workspace
endpoints: claude-sonnet-4-6 at 8192 finishes with finish_reason=stop.

Changes:

1. `src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/engine.py`
   New `CHAT_MAX_TOKENS` (env `ONTOBRICKS_CHAT_MAX_TOKENS`, default 8192) used
   for every chat LLM call instead of the literal 2048.
2. `tests/units/agents/test_agent_dtwin_chat_engine.py`
   Contract: a chat turn requests a token budget of at least 8192.

Modified files:
- src/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/engine.py
- tests/units/agents/test_agent_dtwin_chat_engine.py

